id: PropagateTagsAndPerformers
name: Propagate Tags and Performers to Related Entities
metadata:
  description: "Copies tags and performers from related entities onto the entity that links them.\n\nThirteen paths, each off until you enable it. Tags onto Scenes from their performers, studio, markers or groups; onto Galleries from their images; onto Images from their galleries; onto Groups from their scenes, studio, sub-groups, and from those scenes' performers and markers. Performers onto Scenes from their galleries, and onto Galleries from their images.\n\nCopy, never move - nothing is ever removed from the source.\n\nThree ways to run it: buttons on the target's Edit tab or the source's own detail page, automatically whenever Stash saves an entity, or as one library-wide task in Settings - Tasks - Plugin Tasks. The buttons and the automatic modes are off until you enable them below.\n\nThe task lists every change before writing any of them - nothing lands until you press Proceed, and Undo takes the run back while the dialog stays open.\n\nBACK UP YOUR DATABASE BEFORE THE FIRST RUN - it rewrites tag and performer assignments across the whole library and Stash has no undo.\n\nRequires Stash 0.31.0 or newer."
version: 0.13.1
